 [['否定性质或态度','obey · obedient · disobedient；honour · dishonour；honest · dishonest'],['断开连接、解除缠绕','connect · disconnect · disconnection；engage · disengage · disengagement；entangle · disentangle'],['撤除、纠正与赋权反向','infect · disinfect · disinfection；enfranchise · disenfranchise；abuse · disabuse'],['变化和辨清意义','colour · discolour · discoloured；ambiguity · disambiguation · disambiguate']],
